&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Initial experience with IFRS is an advantage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German (minimum B2 level) and English, both written and spoken, are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Very good Datev skills; knowledge of further accounting or ERP systems is an advantage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
